    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "German-born creative technology director at MOUTHWASH Studio (Brooklyn, NY -- note: Mouthwash has offices in both LA and NY; Daniel is NY-based per his own site). Specializes in typography and generative processes at the intersection of art, design, and technology. Trajectory: Communication Design at Uni Konstanz (started 2015); DIA Studio Oct 2017 to Jun 2024 (~7 years, four-person core team with founders Mitch Paone and Meg Donohoe); CT Director at MOUTHWASH Studio from mid-2024. Senior director level: ~9 years professional experience, Director title, runs creative technology across client work. Clients include Adidas, Nike, Apple, Google, MoMA, NYT. Also teaches at Pratt Institute and ELISAVA Barcelona; has lectured at MIT Media Lab and The Cooper Union. Hands-on designer and coder: type design (26a1.xyz foundry with retail typefaces), generative identity systems, custom tools. October 2024 Wix Playground article quotes him as operating independently -- treated as transitional or loose language since his own site (primary source) explicitly states CT Director at MW.S and LinkedIn confirms the same; two sources outweigh the one article. Work Status Employed: site + LinkedIn + ZoomInfo all confirm Mouthwash Studio (no net conflicting signal). Email dw@wenzeldaniel.com from personal site. Autonomy 4: director-level with hands-on technical and design execution; works within a studio structure rather than fully independent.",
